Description: Tailscale Linux system tray GUI
 A Linux system tray application for Tailscale that provides a graphical
 interface for managing your tailnet. Features include peer management,
 exit node selection, subnet route advertising, Taildrop file transfer,
 SSH peer launch, multi-account support, and a browser-based status dashboard.
 .
 Requires tailscaled to be running. See: https://tailscale.com/download/linux
